    "title": "A Special Night at Camp",
    "sentences": [
      "At the camp hotel, Kaya watched snow fall on the quiet playground.",
      "Her neighbor shared important research about such wild wolves in the mountains.",
      "First, they discussed moral education, beautiful calligraphy, and their arts and crafts posters.",
      "For home economics, Kaya brought thin fish with soy sauce seasoning and lemonade.",
      "Next, she said, \"We tried hiking and fishing to catch fish.\"",
      "Her neighbor touched Kaya's shoulder and tired arm with a smiling face.",
      "After that, they enjoyed their fourth brass band concert in the hall.",
      "Kaya played her sweet recorder, so people started lively dancing together.",
      "Soon, the sky became quite dark, and a bright star shone outside.",
      "Then, Kaya stopped reading her notebook and slowly rested her heavy head.",
      "Feeling very sleepy, she smiled and said, \"Today was a wonderful day.\""
